---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT a, EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM u WHERE u.a = t.a) AS e FROM t LIMIT 2"
---
Project [a#0, exists#7 AS e#6]
+- Limit 2
   +- Join ExistenceJoin(exists#7), (a#3 == a#0)
      :- Limit 2
      :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0]
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
